15813      infile datalines truncover;
15814      
15815      title 'Quartimin-Rotated Factor Solution with Standard Errors';
15816      input _name_ $ test1-test9;
15817      _type_ = 'corr';
15818      datalines;

NOTE: The data set WORK.TEST has 9 observations and 11 variables.

15828      ;
15829      title2 'A nine-variable-three-factor example';
15830      proc factor data=test method=ml reorder rotate=quartimin
15831      nobs=200 n=3 se cover=.45 alpha=.1;
15832      run;

NOTE: The means of one or more variables in the input data set WORK.TEST are missing and are assumed to be 0.
NOTE: The standard deviations of one or more variables in the input data set WORK.TEST are missing and are assumed to be 1.
NOTE: 3 factors will be retained by the NFACTOR criterion.
NOTE: Convergence criterion satisfied.
